Subject: [PATCH] xt: include libc Ethernet definitions before Linux UAPI

Local musl compatibility fix; preserve xtables support and avoid editing
system headers or redefining kernel compatibility guards globally.

--- a/src/xt.c
+++ b/src/xt.c
@@ -8,6 +8,9 @@
  */
 
 #include <nft.h>
+
+/* Let libc define ethhdr before the Linux UAPI compatibility headers. */
+#include <netinet/if_ether.h>
 
 #include <time.h>
 #include <net/if.h>
